{"info":{"id":"ses_e5117e948ffePeScBIz2X6rxWO","projectID":"255e8ca4ff98560fd9064f56e0ee7dee73b27c2d","model":{"id":"deepseek-v4.1-flash-free","providerID":"opencode","variant":"default"},"cost":0,"tokens":{"input":42102,"output":826,"reasoning":4459,"cache":{"read":119808,"write":0}},"outcome":"failed","time":{"created":1793935808199,"updated":1793936194451,"busy":1793935809851,"idle":1793936194453,"viewed":1793936194453},"title":"Starcraft 3d game build","location":{"directory":"/home/runner/work/PlayGround/PlayGround"}},"messages":[{"id":"msg_1aee816cf001VJXSqwhpfBrdcW","time":{"created":1793935809864},"text":"\"Starcraft 3d\n\n---\nThis is a build request. Build a complete, playable game now (or apply the requested change to the existing game). Do not ask clarifying questions; make reasonable assumptions and note them briefly when you finish.\n\nScreenshots for your own checks: save small JPEGs (a .jpg path, viewport at most 1280px wide) and read only the latest one; older images are dropped from context. Read a full-size PNG only when fine detail matters.\n\"","files":[],"type":"user"},{"id":"msg_1aee81d5c001NrQ7qS16hIZOH2","time":{"created":1793935809891,"streamed":1793935818037,"completed":1793935818071},"type":"assistant","agent":"build","model":{"id":"deepseek-v4.1-flash-free","providerID":"opencode","variant":"default"},"content":[{"type":"reasoning","text":"We need build a complete playable game in repo. Need inspect.","native":{"reasoningField":"reasoning_content"},"time":{"created":1793935816290,"completed":1793935818024}},{"type":"tool","id":"call_f9b1abd4ff464cc5a655478d","name":"shell","executed":false,"state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"ls -la && cat package.json 2>/dev/null | head -100"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"total 44\ndrwxr-xr-x 5 runner runner 4096 Nov  6 03:30 .\ndrwxr-xr-x 3 runner runner 4096 Nov  6 03:28 ..\ndrwxr-xr-x 5 runner runner 4096 Nov  6 03:29 .agents\ndrwxr-xr-x 7 runner runner 4096 Nov  6 03:30 .git\ndrwxr